  <h2 id="introduction">Introduction</h2>
  <p>The Chiller is covered as an Equipment entity rather than part of the Stove directory. Its dedicated page provides a direct route back to the Equipment Hub and related restaurant guides.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The Chiller represents a separate restaurant-equipment topic in the Wiki. Keeping it in its own entry makes it easier to distinguish from cooking stations while browsing equipment information.</p>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
  <p>The Equipment directory organizes restaurant tools by their role in the wider workspace. The Chiller entry connects with restaurant organization guidance without assigning properties that are not presented on this page.</p>

  <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
  <p>Use this page when navigating Chiller information, then continue to the Equipment Hub or related guides for wider restaurant context.</p>

